commit c45551008e151538268c0f7a6421ce8f38b4a4b5
Author: antonio <antoniorees74@gmail.com>
Date:   Sat Aug 22 10:48:48 2026 +0100

    observability: surface agent stream details in durable run events
    
    - widen platform runtime sanitize limits (64 fields, 16 slice, depth 3, 8k strings)
    - preserve safe payload fields into runcontrol with nested flattening
    - make progress coalescing content-aware via payloadHash
    - map reasoning/text as EventMessage, tool_use as distinct progress
    - expose DetailText in run event view and render in run.html timeline
    - keeps SSE plumbing (already text/event-stream) but now carries tool/action/title
    
    Fixes generic 'runtime'/'Tool call' rows seen on agent-harness-study

